# PRD, decision log, and MCP

- **PRD:** Before larger architecture or product decisions, read requirements — `instructions.md` / `PRD.md` when present; until then `AGENTS.md`, `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `docs/pr-merge-gate.md`.
- **`.notes/meeting_notes.md`:** Short dated decisions using **Why / What / Impact / Not done** so later sessions and review bots (Greptile P2) can see the effect of the change.
- **Merge:** Do not land work on `main` outside the dual gate in `docs/pr-merge-gate.md` (required CI green **and** review quiescence, including the arrival wait).
- **MCP:** Enable only with user approval (GitHub issues/PRs, docs search). Do not commit tokens or repo URLs that embed credentials.
